OL,3,C19-year-old man dies after getting
OL,4,Cinto difficulty in water in Lake
OL,5,CDistrict
OL,7,FA 19-year-old man has died after
OL,8,Fgetting into difficulty in the water
OL,9,Fat Grasmere lake on Saturday (8th
OL,10,FAugust).
OL,12,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,13,Fafter emergency services were called
OL,14,Fto the scene shortly after 4.30pm.
OL,16,FHe was taken to hospital but later
OL,17,Fdied. His family has been informed.
OL,19,FThe man's death is not being treated
OL,20,Fas suspicious but officers are working
OL,21,Fto establish what happened.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/2
